  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mugogo lowland cave system and contributing sub-catchment analysis for flood control and land restoration of the upstream  catchments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of this assignment is to prepare a submission-ready &#xbf;Detailed design&#xbf; and tender documents, including the necessary supporting information, analysis and modeling to inform the impact of the flood control measures and suggest appropriate measures. The proposed measures being broken down into feasibility study and a detailed design study based on the selected scenario (from feasibility study). in accordance with the World Bank Environmental and social safeguard using Kinoni, Karagosub-catchment as the model&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
